1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,896
Part seven. Site survey and site photos.

2
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:07,749
Before quoting, someone visits the roof.

3
00:00:07,749 --> 00:00:10,617
Open the lead and tap Schedule survey.

4
00:00:10,617 --> 00:00:12,881
The lead is already filled in.

5
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:16,660
Fill the survey date and the surveyor.

6
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:21,603
At the site, record the roof type, the usable roof area, shading,

7
00:00:21,603 --> 00:00:27,383
the sanctioned load on the electricity bill, and the capacity you recommend.

8
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:30,023
Now the site photos.

9
00:00:30,023 --> 00:00:31,323
Tap Site photo.

10
00:00:31,323 --> 00:00:38,515
SuryaSetu's own camera opens and shows where you are: the town, district and state,

11
00:00:38,515 --> 00:00:44,320
the Plus Code, latitude and longitude, and how accurate the GPS is.

12
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:48,596
Tap the round button to take the photo.

13
00:00:48,596 --> 00:00:53,370
The place, a small map, the coordinates, date and time,

14
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:57,537
the job details and a QR code are stamped on it.

15
00:00:57,537 --> 00:00:58,753
Tap Use photo.

16
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:05,929
The photo is saved on the survey, and also on the customer and the project,

17
00:01:05,929 --> 00:01:07,938
with its place and time.

18
00:01:07,938 --> 00:01:09,864
Tap it to see it large.

19
00:01:09,864 --> 00:01:14,301
Take as many as you need: roof, meter, inverter wall.

20
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:19,932
Next video: Quotations: GST quotes with savings.

